	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="left" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadowblade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A deadly attack from behind while using stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Reconnoiter </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases recon skills by 10 for better stealth and damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bleed </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A piercing attack that also deals damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Impale </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">High damage attack that also lowers a targets defense against piercing. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Hunter&#39;s Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stalk </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Back Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An archery attack from behind. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Open Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once ignoring some enemy armor. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Blade Flurry </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Gives you a chance for an extra melee strike to target and another target on each successful strike. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Hunt </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Allows stealthed movement and the ability to see hidden enemies. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Survival Instincts </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases parry and defense skills while lowering attack speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Pounce </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Attacks up to 5 creatures in the same encounter from stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shrouded Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A flanking attack that deals medium damage and stealths the predator. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Phyn&#39;s Hunting Hawk </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a friendly animal to the ranger&#39;s side. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Wounding Arrow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ranged attack that lowers a targets parry and deflection ability on hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Makeshift Arrow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">arrows from scrap wood. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shadowflame </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A high fire damage stealth attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Steady Aim </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases your ranged skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Corner </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A medium range attack the decreases enemy defense. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Impede </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases enemy movement speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Shadow Lunge </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires stealth and a position behind the enemy. A ranged attack that deals very high damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Trick Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ranged attack that deals little damage but whoever hits it next gets added hate applied to them. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility and stalk skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Natural Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases ranged attack and stalk skills. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin/Brigand/Dirge<br />Ranger/Swashbuckler/Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Escape </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ports your group to zone in. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Leaping Cut </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A ranged extra attack that deals piercing damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Hidden Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals High damage from a distance. It requires a ranger to equip a bow and be in stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Forester&#39;s Insight </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increase agility and movement speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lunging Thrust </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A ranged attack that decreases enemy defense. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Triple Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A series of three ranged attacks if one misses the series ends. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your thread level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lightning Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A quick attack that deals lightning damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Sniping Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Requires position behind the enemy and a ranged weapon. An extra long ranged attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </